<title>NEW ZEALAND: Citibank drops NZ fixed mortgage lending rates.</title>
<headline>Citibank drops NZ fixed mortgage lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank on Friday announced it had cut its New Zealand one-year fixed home lending rate to 8.75 percent from 8.95 percent, and its two and three year rates to 8.95 percent from 9.25 percent and 9.75 percent respectively.</p>
<p>Citibank's four and five year rates are 9.5 percent.</p>
<p>Its floating rate remains unchanged at 9.4 percent.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
